// ============================================================================
// EXPORTS
// ============================================================================

// Go: js_pybin. Every user visible binary operator of the Python
// compiler goes through here so an instance of a user class can answer it with a
// dunder. THE ORDER OF THE ARMS IS THE SPECIFICATION: the bit operators are
